# ============================================================
# ARIS Visio PDF Converter
# Parses a business flow PDF (exported from Visio) and
# extracts structured business rules, filter conditions,
# flow logic, and version history into machine-readable JSON.
#
# RUN FROM PROJECT ROOT:
# python visio_converter\pdf_converter.py
#
# CONFIGURE:
# Set PDF_FILENAME and FLOW_NAME in config\aris_config.py
# Place your PDF file in the pdfs\ folder
#
# VISIO STRUCTURE SUPPORTED:
# - Rounded rectangle (top) = Campaign/source metadata
# - Diamond = Decision / filter condition (YES/NO)
# - Rectangle = Process / action step
# - Hexagon = END / STOP state
# - Information box = Notes and reference rules
# - Version history table = outside-flow document metadata
# - Arrow labels: YES (continue) / NO (exclude/branch)
# ============================================================

